{"lines":[{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.5,"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"w":0.11326302846272786,"h":0.014905888003651446,"x":0.11517918524593303,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.053593567610884962,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.11934157278784577,"t":"On the positive side, they know that Icelandic is still the official language of education and","w":0.66255142211914064,"y":0.097383720823929099},{"t":"government. It has survived for well over a thousand years and the experts predict that its","x":0.11728394236505703,"y":0.11189634877397403,"w":0.66460906982421875,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"future in this nation state is sound and will continue to be so. However, there's no doubt that","y":0.12375320433333747,"w":0.68324335734049479,"h":0.015191296104547947,"c":1,"x":0.11722221812267113},{"x":0.1172839605543597,"y":0.14098837198590031,"t":"it's becoming an inevitable second choice in young people's lives.","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.48971191406249998},{"t":"This raises important questions. When you consider how much of the past is tied up in","c":1,"y":0.16133720919472427,"x":0.11728394618158612,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.63991770426432293},{"c":1,"w":0.63590911865234379,"t":"a language, will young Icelanders lose their sense of their own identity? Another issue","x":0.11723366254957313,"h":0.014235647603676349,"y":0.17501677717108466},{"t":"that concerns the government of Iceland is this. If children are learning two languages","x":0.11728395518115993,"y":0.19040697663559947,"c":1,"w":0.63580245971679683,"h":0.011627907185728703},{"t":"through different routes, neither of which they are fully fluent in, will they be able to express","y":0.2049418603438673,"h":0.013081395583944611,"x":0.11522632723829,"c":1,"w":0.67695475260416671},{"t":"themselves properly?","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.11728395197070715,"w":0.16049382527669273,"y":0.21937573599791205},{"x":0.83539094688332005,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166489,"t":"Q39","y":0.17587209286482275},{"y":0.19040697660335659,"x":0.83333333393687814,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q40"},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.03497942288716635,"t":"106","x":0.11728395105641681,"y":0.86773255797690307,"c":1},{"x":0.66991094639740412,"w":0.30613845825195307,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.95311055968589831,"h":0.033792529426278195}],"w":2400,"h":3395}